@prefix sstim-eco: <https://w3id.org/sstim/ecosystem#> .

# Overlay on a conforming relationship. Even though mailto: is syntactically an
# IRI, a contact address must never be publishable as an ecosystem target.

<https://w3id.org/sstim/ecosystem-record/relationship/synthetic-alex-outreach-resonance>
    sstim-eco:relationshipTarget <mailto:private-contact@example.net> .
